## To-be: el estado objetivo

```mermaid
graph TB
{% for layer in to_be.layers %}
  subgraph L{{ loop.index }}["{{ layer.name }}"]
{% for c in layer.components %}
    L{{ loop.index }}C{{ loop.index0 }}["{{ c }}"]
{% endfor %}
  end
{% endfor %}
{% for layer in to_be.layers[:-1] %}
  L{{ loop.index }} <--> L{{ loop.index + 1 }}
{% endfor %}
```

